Package: lion-locker
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: libc6, dbus, systemd (>= 248), libpam0g, libpam-modules, lion-lockscreen
Recommends: lion-session, lion-notifications, lion-greeter
Description: LionOS secure screen lock (spec 03)
 Locks the screen through ext-session-lock-v1: the compositor itself
 guarantees that nothing but the lock surface is visible or focusable and
 keeps the screen locked if the locker crashes. Re-authenticates the
 session owner with PAM, locks before suspend through a logind delay
 inhibitor and serves os.lionos.Locker1 on the session bus.
 .
 Fail-closed by design: a crash, a UI failure or a missing compositor
 never leaves the session unlocked.
